cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Optical Navigation UE5 Simulator"
abstract: >-
  An Unreal Engine 5 simulator for vision-based / optical UAV navigation
  research. Flies a simulated quadcopter along scripted spline paths while
  recording nadir imagery with dense 6-DoF ground truth, north- and
  west-facing skyline imagery with derived binary sky masks, and a per-run
  manifest of coordinate conventions, camera calibration and environment
  configuration.
type: software
authors:
